s for residential, commercial and utility applications.", "founded_year": "1985", "employee_count": "500-999", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='sunpower-corporation' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='SunSpark Technology, based in Hemet, California, with a facility in Riverside, was founded in 2008 as a manufacturer of solar photovoltaic panels and modules. The company produces thin-film photovoltaic panels using cadmium telluride technology, as well as monocrystalline and polycrystalline PV panels. Solar modules are built with tempered glass and anodized aluminum frames. SunSpark serves commercial, industrial, military, and government customers, along with residential clients. The company emphasizes cutting-edge engineering and design practices to guarantee high-quality results, driven by a passion for creating superior solar modules that deliver optimal sustainability and efficiency.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Thin-film photovoltaic panel manufacturing (cadmium telluride)", "Monocrystalline PV panel manufacturing", "Polycrystalline PV panel manufacturing", "Solar module assembly with tempered glass and anodized aluminum frames"], "industries": ["Commercial", "Industrial", "Military", "Government", "Residential"], "materials": ["Cadmium telluride", "Tempered glass", "Anodized aluminum"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Thin-film photovoltaic panels using cadmium telluride technology", "Solar modules built with tempered glass and anodized aluminum", "Cutting-edge engineering and design practices guarantee highest quality results", "Passionate about creating superior solar modules for optimal sustainability and efficiency"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2008 -> db", "Headquarters Hemet, California -> db", "Employee count 10-49 -> db", "Manufactures thin-film photovoltaic panels using cadmium telluride technology -> db description", "Solar modules built with tempered glass and anodized aluminum -> db description", "Serves commercial, government, military, industrial clients -> db description", "Products: Monocrystalline PV Panels, Polycrystalline PV Panel