UPDATE companies SET description='Sunny Side Solutions operates from Prior Lake, Minnesota, serving the greater Minneapolis–Saint Paul area. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure in public materials. It presents itself as a full‑service electrical contractor focused exclusively on solar energy systems.

