UPDATE companies SET description='Sunnyside Solar is based in Guilford, Vermont. Founded by solar pioneers Richard Gottlieb and Carol Levin, the company has operated for nearly 40 years, providing solar energy solutions across Vermont and New England. It is a family-owned business, currently led by Joseph and Rosemary Mangum, who continue the legacy on their homestead after relocating from a previous location near Chelsea Royal.

