UPDATE companies SET description='Surface Mount Depot, now operating as SMD, was founded in 1988 in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma. The company began as a specialist in surface mount technology and has grown into a full-service contract electronics manufacturer serving industrial and high-reliability markets.

