UPDATE companies SET description='Sustainable Island Products is a family-owned and operated wholesale distributor headquartered in Kailua-Kona on the island of Hawaii. Co-owners John Elkjer (CEO) and Julie Elkjer (president) lead the company with their daughter Elizabeth Elkjer as vice president of sales. The business was built on a mission to supply Hawaii''s food-service operators with high-quality sustainable packaging backed by service that builds real relationships.

