UPDATE companies SET description='Sustainergy Cooperative operates from Cincinnati, Ohio, serving the Columbus and Greater Cincinnati region. The company is structured as a worker-owned cooperative, meaning every employee has the opportunity to become a worker-owner. The founding year and founders are not publicly disclosed.

The firm provides a suite of building-envelope and renewable-energy services. Its insulation work covers attic, wall, and crawl-space installation, along with air sealing and removal of old or damaged material. Crawl-space encapsulation is backed by a ten-year warranty. On the solar side, Sustainergy designs and installs custom rooftop photovoltaic systems and integrates battery storage for backup power. The company also offers free home energy audits to identify efficiency opportunities.

Customers include homeowners and businesses across the Columbus and Greater Cincinnati area. Residential clients such as Tom C., Gary D., and Larry M. have used the cooperative for both insulation upgrades and solar installations, reporting reduced electric bills and improved comfort. Commercial projects are referenced through the “Solar for Home or Business” messaging, though specific industrial clients are not named.

Sustainergy positions itself as the only local contractor specializing in both insulation and solar, arguing that the two measures are more effective together. The worker-ownership model is cited as a differentiator, with the company stating that employees who hold a stake in the business deliver higher-quality service because their success is tied to the customer’s outcome.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Attic insulation installation", "Wall insulation installation", "Crawl space insulation installation", "Air sealing", "Crawl space encapsulation", "Insulation removal", "Custom rooftop solar photovoltaic system installation", "Solar battery storage installation", "Home energy auditing", "Indoor air quality services"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Only company in Columbus & Greater Cincinnati specializing in both insulation and solar installation", "Worker-owned cooperative structure with employee ownership pathway", "10-year warranty on crawlspace encapsulation", "Free home energy audits for Ohio residents", "Integrated approach combining building envelope and renewable energy"], "facts_used": ["Company name, HQ city/state, description -> db", "Worker-owned cooperative structure -> / (ABOUT US section)", "Services: insulation (attic, wall, crawl space), air sealing, crawl space encapsulation, insulation removal, solar panel installation, solar battery storage, home energy audit -> / (Our Services section)", "Only company specializing in both insulation and solar in the area -> / (The Only Insulation & Solar Installation Expert section)", "10-year warranty on crawlspace encapsulation -> / (capabilities list)", "Customer testimonials (Tom C., Gary D., Larry M.) -> / (testimonials section)", "Free Ohio home energy audit -> / (industries_served list)"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "typ