UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1992 in Tucson, Arizona, Switchgear Solutions began as a circuit breaker rebuilding and switchgear maintenance company. It now operates a 46,000‑square‑foot manufacturing and service facility in Tucson as an IPS Company.

