UPDATE companies SET description='T.O. Plastics, Inc. operates from Clearwater, Minnesota, where it was founded in 1948.

The company specializes in custom plastic roll stock extrusion, producing utility‑grade to prime high‑impact polystyrene (HIPS) in a range of gauges, colors, and volumes. Secondary operations include 5‑axis CNC routing, multiple trim methods, coordinate‑measuring‑machine inspection, assembly, bonding, kitting, labeling, and lid‑stock sealing. Facility size and headcount are not disclosed.

T.O. Plastics serves medical, pharmaceutical, and life‑science customers with Class 8 cleanroom‑certified packaging such as sterile barrier components, shipping trays, and work‑in‑process trays. It also supplies industrial manufacturers, electronics firms needing static‑dissipative and conductive trays, consumer‑goods brands for blister and clamshell packaging, agricultural and recreational OEMs for enclosure components, and horticulture growers with plant trays and pots.

The company states its mission is to delight customers through innovative thermoformed solutions, emphasizing vertical integration, diversified capabilities, and a partnership model built on collaboration and shared problem‑solving. Its stated values — safety, great people, results, integrity, tenacity — and vision to be a best‑in‑class manufacturer underpin its operational approach.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic Roll Stock Extrusion", "Heavy Gauge Thermoforming", "Thin Gauge Thermoforming", "Coextrusion", "Design, Engineering, and Tooling Services", "CNC Milling", "CAM Aided Tool Manufacture", "Rapid Prototyping", "3D Printing", "In-line Trim", "Off-line Trim", "Steel Rule Die", "Matched Metal Die", "5-Axis CNC Routing", "Coordinate Measuring Machine Inspection", "Kitting", "Labeling and Barcoding", "Inventory Management", "Lid Stock Sealing", "Assembly/Bonding", "Line Bending", "High-Speed Self-Feed Trimming"], "industries": ["Medical, Pharmaceutical & Life Sciences", "Industrial", "Electronic", "Consumer Packaging", "Agriculture", "Recreational", "Horticulture", "Roll stock markets"], "materials": ["High Impact Polystyrene (HIPS)", "TOPSTAT\u2122 ESD-protective HIPS", "Static dissipative plastics", "Anti-static plastics", "Conductive materials", "Coextrusion-compatible polymers"], "equipment": ["5-Axis CNC router", "Coordinate measuring machines", "Coextrusion lines", "In-line and cut sheet thermoforming equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated extrusion, thermoforming, and tooling under one roof", "Class 8 cleanrooms for medical and pharmaceutical packaging", "5\u2011axis CNC routing for complex trim requirements", "Coextrusion lines enabling multi\u2011material roll stock", "Partnership program focused on joint problem\u2011solving"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1948 -> /about", "Headquarters Clearwater, Minnesota -> db", "Custom plastic roll stock extrusion (HIPS) -> /