UPDATE companies SET description='TCS Electronics, Inc. was founded in 2012 in Farmington, New York.

The firm provides printed circuit board assembly (flexible, surface-mount, multilayer, and plated through-hole), custom wire and cable harnesses (30 to 4/0 gauge, including coaxial, solid, stranded, metallic, sheathed, and ribbon types), and full electro-mechanical box builds integrated with enclosures from its sister company TCS Industries, Inc. Services extend to conformal coating, high-speed machining, functional testing (including LabView-controlled test engineering), flying-probe testing (off-site), component engineering for obsolescence management, and fulfillment with packaging and re-packaging. Production spans prototype through full-rate runs.

Customers serve military, commercial and industrial, transportation, medical, and telecommunications sectors. The company cites work with tier-one military suppliers and global electronics and technology firms.

TCS Electronics emphasizes end-to-end supply-chain management, AS9100D and ISO 9001:2015 quality systems, ITAR registration, and default IPC 610/620 Class II workmanship with Class III available. The model aims to let clients redirect resources to core competencies while reducing material, labor, and capital costs.', certifications=ARRAY['SAE AS9100D','ISO 9001:2015','ITAR','UL E157252','CSA LR109165-1','IPC-610','IPC-620','IPC-J-STD']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB Assembly (flexible, surface mount, multilayer, plated through-hole)", "Wire & Cable Assembly (30 to 4/0 gauge, coaxial, solid, stranded, metallic, sheathed, ribbon)", "Electromechanical Box Build Assembly", "Testing Services (flying probe, functional testing with LabView)", "Conformal Coating", "High-speed Machining", "Component Engineering (obsolescence management)", "Strategic Planning & Project Management", "Fulfillment Services", "Product Packaging & Re-packaging"], "industries": ["Military", "Commercial & Industrial", "Transportation", "Medical", "Telecommunications"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to full production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["AS9100D and ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "ITAR registered", "IPC 610/620 Class II default, Class III on request", "Global supply chain management from prototype to full production", "Electromechanical integration via sister company TCS Industries"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2012 in Farmington, NY -> db", "Contract electronics manufacturer of PCB assemblies, cable/wire harnesses, box builds -> db description", "AS9100D, ISO 9001:2015, ITAR, UL, CSA, IPC certifications -> /quality page", "PCB assembly capabilities: flexible, SMT, multilayer, through-hole -> /capabilities page", "Wire/cable assembly: 30 to 4/0 gauge, various wire types -> /capabilities page", "Electromechanical assembly with sister company TCS Industries -> /capabilities page", "Testing: flying probe (off-site), LabView functio