UPDATE companies SET description='TDO Home Entertainment operates from Lexington, Kentucky, where it began as The Dish Outlet on Palumbo Drive in the mid-1990s. The business was founded to sell and install large satellite dishes, then evolved through the rise of direct-broadcast satellite and the internet era. Today it is a privately owned local company led by owner Brock Bailey, with a team of audio/video experts and sales staff who undergo drug testing, background checks, and ongoing certification training.

The firm provides a full suite of installation and integration services, including home theater and outdoor audio/video installation, structured wiring for builders, security camera systems, home automation, lighting control, wireless networking, cell signal boosting, satellite TV, and conference room AV. Services are delivered from a location on Big Run Road, with technicians handling retrofits, remodels, and custom cabinetry alongside standard installations.

TDO serves residential homeowners, custom builders, and commercial clients needing conference room or video wall setups. Testimonials reference projects ranging from whole-home audio and universal remote programming to security camera installations viewed on smartphones, illustrating a client base that spans single-family homes and small-business environments.

The company rebranded from The Dish Outlet to TDO Home Entertainment because the original name no longer reflected the breadth of its offerings, which had expanded far beyond satellite TV. The ownership says the change was driven by a need to better represent its capabilities and to position itself as a solution provider rather than a single-product dealer.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Audio/video installation", "Builder services & structured wiring", "Cell service boost", "Conference room installation", "Custom cabinetry", "Cutting the cord", "Head-end", "Home automation", "Home theater installation", "Internet service", "Lighting control", "Outdoor audio/video installation", "Retro-fits & remodels", "Satellite TV installation", "Security cameras installation", "Universal remote control", "Whole-home audio", "Wireless networking", "Video wall installation"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Staff are drug tested, background checked, and maintain ongoing certifications", "Privately owned local company with experienced, trained installers", "Free quotes and estimates offered", "Evolved from satellite dish sales to full entertainment and security integration"], "facts_used": ["Lexington, Kentucky headquarters -> db", "Founded as The Dish Outlet in mid-1990s -> /about", "Owner Brock Bailey -> /", "Privately owned local company -> /", "Staff drug tested, background checks, ongoing training -> /", "Services list -> /services", "Rebranding reason -> /about", "Address 242 Big Run Road -> /about", "In business almost 20 years -> /about"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Specializing in Home Theaters & Home Entertainment Systems", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_a