UPDATE companies SET description='TSM Corporation is based in Auburn Hills, Michigan. Founded in 1978, the company began with 10 employees, a single rotary dial machine, and three drill presses.

The company operates as a full-service manufacturer of custom components for automotive powertrain, driveline, and chassis applications. TSM manages in-house tooling and re-tooling, and has delivered design optimizations such as a 25 percent mass reduction and part consolidation on a structural support program.

TSM serves the automotive industry, working with multiple global OEMs and Tier 1 suppliers across more than 40 vehicle platforms. Notable engagements include taking over a failing intake manifold program for a global OEM and re-tooling it within five weeks, and developing a structural support that reduced mass and combined two part numbers for another major automotive manufacturer.

The company emphasizes agile production, positioning itself as a partner for launching new products on tight milestones with high quality. Its quality culture engages all employees and business partners, underpinned by IATF 16949 and ISO 14001 certifications. TSM''s stated mission is to achieve unsurpassed manufacturing quality through intelligent, cost-effective solutions for complicated engineering designs, leveraging global partnerships and a highly qualified workforce.', certifications=ARRAY['IATF 16949','ISO 14001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom component manufacturing for automotive powertrain, driveline, and chassis", "Dedicated machining centers", "24/7 production operations", "Design to delivery (concept through SOP)", "In-house tooling and re-tooling", "Design optimization (mass reduction, part consolidation)", "Quality assurance (IATF 16949)", "Environmental management (ISO 14001)", "Global supply chain management", "Program management for high-volume and high-complexity projects"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Automotive OEM", "Tier 1 Automotive Supplier"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Rotary dial machine", "Drill presses", "Dedicated machining centers", "Production machines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Agile production: trusted partner for on-time launches under tight milestones", "Quality culture engaging all employees and partners, certified to IATF 16949 and ISO 14001", "Full-service capabilities from design through start of production", "Global reach serving multiple OEMs and Tier 1 suppliers across 40+ vehicle platforms"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1978 with 10 employees, a rotary dial machine, and three drill presses -> /about-us", "200,000 sq ft production space -> /about-us", "180+ employees -> /about-us", "200+ production machines -> /about-us", "40+ dedicated machining centers -> /", "24/7 operations -> /", "IATF 16949 certified -> /about-us", "ISO 14001 certified -> /about-us", "Serves m