UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Mt. Juliet, Tennessee, Tachi-S Engineering U.S.A., Inc. operates as the North American arm of a global automotive seat manufacturer with over 64 years of seating experience. The company focuses on creating high-quality automotive seats that are functional, safe, stylish, and comfortable to support automotive manufacturers'' global vehicle launches.

Tachi-S provides end-to-end seating solutions, from design and development through prototyping and manufacturing. Its capabilities include trim, foam, and metal prototyping; complete just-in-time and frame assembly; prototype fixture and frame modification; and a full range of seat testing services, including a Servo Sled for collision simulation. The company reports annual deliveries of over 3 million complete seats and 4 million seat components to the global automotive market.

The company serves automotive original equipment manufacturers (OEMs) producing cars, trucks, and SUVs worldwide. Its programs span concept to mass production, with an emphasis on pre-production prototype events and production support.

Tachi-S states that its success is built on being responsive, flexible, and easy to work with, ensuring every seating program is completed on time, on budget, and with high quality. Its quality policy commits to products that inspire confidence and excitement, while its corporate philosophy aims to deliver inspirational experiences through technology as a brand.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Automotive seating design & development", "Prototyping (trim, foam, metal)", "Manufacturing (complete JIT and frame assembly)", "Seat testing (Servo Sled collision simulation)", "Prototype fixture and frame modification", "Trim and complete seat assembly for pre-production", "Production pad changes during tool modification", "Sheet metal fabrication, wire bending, and machining"], "industries": ["Automotive OEMs", "Automotive manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Servo Sled"], "volume": "Prototype to mass production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 3 million complete seats and 4 million components delivered annually", "Responsive, flexible, and easy to work with", "On-time, on-budget program delivery", "Servo Sled collision simulation testing", "Complete JIT and frame assembly from plant to customer"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Mt. Juliet, Tennessee -> db", "Over 64 years of automotive seat manufacturing experience -> /about-us", "Delivers over 3 million complete automotive seats and over 4 million seat components annually -> /about-us", "Design, development, prototyping, manufacturing, and testing of automotive seats -> /capabilities", "Servo Sled collision simulation testing -> industries_served array", "Complete JIT and frame assembly from plant to customer -> /products array", "Responsive, flexible, easy to work with; on-time, on-budget delivery -> /about-us", "Global Seat System Creator -> /about-us", "Automotive OEM customers -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "typ