UPDATE companies SET description='Tampa Metal Works Inc operates from Tampa, Florida, where it has provided metal fabrication and installation services across the state for nearly 40 years. The company is locally owned and operated, though no founding year or founder names are disclosed.

The shop specializes in custom metal fabrication, including in-house manufacturing of scuppers, downspouts, handrails, chimney caps, and collector boxes using brake metal and flat stock. It also performs field welding and on-site installation, and offers prompt delivery services. The facility warehouses a broad inventory of flat stock to support quick turnaround.

The company serves projects throughout Hillsborough, Pinellas, Pasco, Polk, Manatee, Hardee, Highlands, Sarasota, and DeSoto counties, with nationwide shipping available.

Tampa Metal Works emphasizes its understanding of contractor challenges, citing durable results, fast turnaround from stocked inventory, and reliable delivery as key differentiators. It holds a Florida roofing contractor license (CCC1329561) and follows SMACNA standards, with memberships in FRSA and NRCA.', certifications=ARRAY['Licensed Roofing Contractor (License # CCC1329561)','Florida Roofing and Sheet Metal Contractors Association (FRSA) member','National Roofing Contractors Association (NRCA) member','Follows Sheet Metal and Air Conditioning Contractors'' National Association (SMACNA) standards']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "In-house manufacturing", "Field welding", "On-site installation", "Prompt delivery", "Brake metal forming", "Scupper fabrication", "Downspout fabrication", "Handrail fabrication", "Chimney cap fabrication", "Collector box fabrication", "Drainage solutions"], "industries": ["Commercial construction", "Roofing", "Sheet metal fabrication", "Contractor services"], "materials": ["Brake metal", "Flat stock"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Wide flat-stock inventory enabling fast turnaround", "Reliable delivery services to keep projects on schedule", "In-house fabrication combined with on-site welding and installation", "Licensed roofing contractor (CCC1329561) following SMACNA standards", "Nearly 40 years serving Florida contractors"], "facts_used": ["Location: Tampa, Florida -> /", "Nearly 40 years of service -> /about-us", "Locally owned and operated -> /about-us", "Custom fabrication, installation, delivery -> /, /about-us", "Products: scuppers, downspouts, handrails, chimney caps, collector boxes -> /, /services", "Processes: in-house manufacturing, field welding, on-site installation, brake metal forming -> /, /services", "Flat stock inventory for fast turnaround -> /, /services", "Service areas: multiple Florida counties, nationwide shipping -> /, /about-u