UPDATE companies SET description='Tekin, Inc. operates from McCall, Idaho, where it designs and manufactures electronic speed controls, brushless and brushed motors, servos, LiHV batteries, and proprietary connectors for radio-control vehicles. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed in the available sources.

The product line spans multiple ESC platforms — including the RX8 GEN3 for 1:8-scale racing, the RSX Pro for modified competition, the compact RS GEN3 series, the BXR brushed reversing controller, and the RX4 HardBox rock-crawling unit — alongside the Eliminator and GEN4 brushless motor families, the GEN4 SPEC-R spec-class motors, 5-Slot brushed crawler motors, full-aluminum-housing servos with digital magnetic position encoding, and POWER CELL LiHV battery packs in 1S–4S configurations. Tekin also produces the Pro-Lock Bullet connector, which uses a patented internal locking mechanism and tool-less thumb-nut release.

Customers range from professional RC racers and no-prep drag teams to scale crawler enthusiasts and hobbyists. The RX8 GEN3 is noted as a choice of top drivers worldwide; the TYPE-D 4-pole 12-slot motor targets no-prep drag racing; the BXR and RX4 serve trail and rock-crawling applications; and the 5-Slot brushed motors address micro-crawler builds. Tekin also runs a custom-build series, Tekin Adventures, showcasing 3D-printed and kit-based projects.

The company emphasizes racer-driven development — "Built for racers by racers" — and differentiates through field-tunable firmware via the HotWire programming device, Active Drag technology for throttle control, Element Proof sealing for all-weather durability, and Ultra-Low Resistance (ULR) motor windings. The Pro-Lock connector was created to eliminate connection fatigue and finger injuries common with traditional bullet plugs.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electronic speed control (ESC) design and manufacturing", "Brushless motor design and manufacturing", "Brushed motor design and manufacturing", "Servo design and manufacturing", "LiHV battery pack assembly", "Connector design and manufacturing", "Firmware development and over-the-air updates", "HotWire PC-based tuning interface", "Custom RC vehicle prototyping and builds"], "industries": ["Radio-control (RC) racing", "RC drag racing / no-prep", "RC rock crawling and scale trailing", "RC hobby and enthusiast market"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Proprietary Pro-Lock Bullet connector with internal locking mechanism and tool-less release", "HotWire programming device and firmware ecosystem for ESC/motor tuning", "Active Drag technology for smooth throttle and drag-brake control", "Element Proof sealing on ESCs and servos for all-weather operation", "ULR (Ultra-Low Resistance) motor winding technology for spec and modified classes"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: McCall, Idaho -> db", "Pro-Lock Bullet connector proprietary design with internal locking mechanism and tool-less thumb-nut release -> pages./", "RX8 GEN3 1:8 scale racing ESC chosen by top drivers worldwide -> pages./", "RSX Pro modified ESC with HotWire tuning -> pages./", "TYPE-D 4-pole 12-slot drag racing motor -> pages./", "Tekin servos with full aluminum housing, digital magnetic position encoding, precision metal gears, Element Proof design -> pages.