Texas Kings Textile serves international buyers across Latin America, Africa, Asia, and the Middle East. Named destination markets include Bolivia, Chile, the Democratic Republic of Congo, Liberia, Burkina Faso, Ghana, Zambia, Sharjah, Thailand, the Philippines, Cambodia, Guinea, Cameroon, Nigeria, Malawi, Senegal, Mali, and Jordan.

