UPDATE companies SET description='The Tri-M Group, LLC was founded in 1964 by brothers Tom and Dick Musser in Kennett Square, Pennsylvania. Originally a small industrial and commercial electrical contractor, the company has grown to over 500 employees and operates from its headquarters in Kennett Square with additional offices in Lock Haven and Quakertown, Pennsylvania, Middletown, Delaware, and Baltimore, Maryland. In a move to preserve its independent culture and the legacy of founder Tom Musser, the company transitioned to 100% employee ownership through an Employee Stock Ownership Plan (ESOP).

The company provides design, installation, and ongoing service for critical infrastructure including high‑voltage electrical construction, building automation, data and telecommunications networks, security systems, and energy analytics. Its service portfolio covers 24/7 emergency and scheduled maintenance, preventative maintenance, panel fabrication, remote engineering, and hardware/software replacement. With a workforce exceeding 500, Tri‑M handles projects ranging from commercial buildings to industrial facilities across the Mid‑Atlantic region.

Tri‑M serves customers in energy analytics, building automation, security, network infrastructure, electrical construction, and high‑voltage sectors.

The company emphasizes its employee‑owned structure, a safety‑first culture, ethical decision‑making, collaborative problem‑solving, and a proprietary project‑navigation tool (ProNav) that lets customers track service requests and project progress in real time. A stated environmental goal aims to cut operational greenhouse‑gas emissions by roughly 10% by 2030.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["24/7 Emergency Service", "Scheduled Maintenance", "Flexible Service Contracts", "Building Automation System Design & Installation", "Security System Integration", "Preventative Maintenance", "Hardware/Software Replacement", "Remote Engineering Support", "Network Infrastructure Services", "Panel Fabrication", "Electrical Construction", "High Voltage Installation", "Energy Analytics", "Customer Training", "Safety Programs"], "industries": ["Energy Analytics", "Energy Efficiency", "Energy Benchmarking", "Building Automation", "Security Systems", "Network Infrastructure", "Electrical Construction", "High Voltage"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% employee\u2011owned via ESOP", "24/7/365 emergency service coverage", "ProNav online project\u2011tracking platform", "Over 500 employee\u2011owners", "Commitment to reduce GHG emissions 10% by 2030"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1964 by Tom & Dick Musser -> /about", "Headquartered in Kennett Square, PA with offices in Lock Haven, Quakertown, Middletown DE, Baltimore MD -> /", "Over 500 employees -> /about", "100% employee-owned via ESOP -> /about", "Services: design, installation, service of high voltage, electrical construction, building automation, data/telecom networks, security, energy analytics -> /", "24/7 emergency service, preventative maintenance, panel fabrication, remote engineering, ProNav tool -> /services, /", "Core values: safety, ethics, collaboration, superior service, empower future -> /about", "Environmental commitment: reduce